OL,3,GNEWSANew hospitals must offer emergency
OL,4,Acare, NHS told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe medical group advising NHS bosses
OL,7,Fwhich services should be provided at
OL,8,Ftwo new hospital sites says they must
OL,9,Fboth offer 24/7 emergency care.
OL,11,FTwo new hospitals are under
OL,12,Fconstruction at the James Paget in
OL,13,FGorleston and the Queen Elizabeth in
OL,14,FKing's Lynn.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
