PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1792571164
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew hospitals must offer emergency
OL,4,Acare, NHS told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Norfolk and Waveney University
OL,7,FHospitals Group (NWHG) is in the
OL,8,Fprocess of planning which departments
OL,9,Fwill be established and - with
OL,10,Fcampaigners concerned that some
OL,11,Fservices could be reduced - has
OL,12,Finsisted no final decisions have been
OL,13,Fmade.
OL,15,FDr Bernard Brett, chair of the clinical
OL,16,Fadvisory group, told the BBC: "All the
OL,17,Fclinicians together feel there has to
OL,18,Fbe access to 24-hour emergency care" at
OL,19,Fall three of Norfolk's hospitals.
